# Intentionally sets nothing.
#
# This file is committed, so Create React App reads it during the Vercel build.
# REACT_APP_API_URL must stay unset there: unset means the frontend uses
# relative URLs, which is what routes requests through the fe/vercel.json proxy
# and keeps the session cookie first-party. Setting it here would point every
# deployed request at that host instead and break login.
#
# For local development, fe/.env.local sets it to http://localhost:5173.
# .env.local is git-ignored and takes precedence over this file.
